* The dispatch of the multiplication loop at the machine (Lean ` mulBody ` 's ` ite ` ): on a set multiplier bit the test ` ra = some true ` holds and ` dup x t s ; add w t s w ` (~ tmcmltr ) adds the shifted multiplicand into the accumulator within the per-iteration budget; on a clear bit the test fails and the accumulator is unchanged (Lean ` condAdd ` , ` mulGo_append ` ).

